          "stem_markdown": "The random variable $X$ has the distribution $N(31.2, 10.4^2)$. Two independent random values of $X$, denoted by $X_1$ and $X_2$, are chosen.\n\nFind $P(X_1 > 3X_2)$.\n\n[5]",
