              "is_final_answer": false,
              "sequence_number": 2,
              "content_markdown": "B(31, 0.3), P(X ≤ 4) = 0.7^{31} + 31×0.7^{30}×0.3 + ^{31}C_{2}×0.7^{29}×0.3^{2} + ^{31}C_{3}×0.7^{28}×0.3^{3} + ^{31}C_{4}×0.7^{27}×0.3^{4} = 0.00001577 + 0.0002096 + 0.0013475 + 0.0055826 + 0.016748",
              "guidance_markdown": "No end errors.",
              "source_page_numbers": [
